77
00:06:16.134 --> 00:06:23.089
(narrator) A suave secret agent in a dinner jacket and bow tie, martini in hand, appears in a spotlight and says: Gateway, Payment Gateway.

78
00:06:23.089 --> 00:06:25.751
(narrator) Agent Payment Gateway's secret is which provider.

79
00:06:25.751 --> 00:06:28.957
