96
00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:25.160
♪ That’s the payoff Parnas promised: ♪

97
00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:28.040
♪ change one module, leave the rest alone; ♪

98
00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:31.140
