167
00:11:53.847 --> 00:11:56.807
♪ (crowd) Contract! Callers need to know! ♪

168
00:11:56.807 --> 00:11:59.947
♪ Private field, but pay() returns a PayPal Charge. Hidden? ♪

169
00:11:59.947 --> 00:12:02.427
